        "ff72739d-90fa-44b3-896f-ca72e4704c77": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p>Experience the future of gaming comfort with the <strong>SIHOO X5 Gaming Chair Series</strong>.</p><p>Effortlessly switch between vibrant backrests to suit your style, enjoy dynamic armrests that move with you, and customise every detail to fit your comfort needs with this <a href=\"https://xallking.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://xallking.com.au/\">ergonomic gaming chair</a>. With a generous recline range and adaptable support, this <a href=\"https://sihoo.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://sihoo.com.au/\">ergonomic chair</a> takes your gaming experience to the next level. Built to the highest safety standards, it’s a reliable upgrade to any gaming setup. Transform your space with the X5—where style meets performance, tailored for Australian gamers!</p><ul><li><strong>Headrest</strong>: <strong>Double Joint Headrest</strong> – Offers adjustable support with two-way movement to fit your neck comfortably, reducing strain and enhancing ergonomic support.</li><li><strong>Lumbar Support</strong>: <strong>C-Type Adjustable Lumbar Support</strong> – Designed to provide personalised lower back support, ensuring comfort and reducing fatigue over extended sitting periods.</li><li><strong>Backrest</strong>: <strong>3-Zone Elastic Backrest</strong> – Divided into three ergonomic zones, this backrest adapts to your body’s contours, delivering targeted support for your upper, mid, and lower back.</li><li><strong>Armrest</strong>: <strong>3D/6D Synchronous Tilting Armrest</strong> – These versatile armrests move in multiple directions and synchronise with the backrest’s recline, allowing you to maintain natural arm support in any position.</li><li><strong>Cushion</strong>: <strong>Saddle-Type Pressure Dividing Seat Cushion</strong> – Shaped to evenly distribute pressure, this saddle-style cushion reduces discomfort, making it perfect for long gaming or work sessions.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": true,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "ae5c0b7e-ed16-49ec-a868-6b6e2ba54cc3": {
