      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Ezenpy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Enhanced Lumbar Protection with Dual 'C' Lumbar Support",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_zTWjfW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Enhanced Lumbar Protection with Dual 'C' Lumbar Support<br/></h3><p>Alleviate lower back strain with the dual ‘C’ design, offering multidimensional support, vertical adjustments by 5cm, and horizontal coverage for the waist muscles.</p><p></p><h4>3-Zone Elastic Backrest</h4><p>The <strong>3-Zone Elastic Backrest</strong> is structured to offer focused support for your upper, middle, and lower back. This ergonomic design aligns with your spine's natural shape, giving you the support you need to maintain comfort and posture throughout the day.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_UyLx7m": {
