          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Double C-Shaped Wrap Waist Pillow</h3><p>It offers tailored lumbar support, perfectly aligning with the natural curve of your lower back. This ergonomic design helps alleviate pressure on the spine, supporting a healthy posture for extended gaming or work sessions.</p>",
