        "text_axbVMa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Double Joint Headrest</h3><p>It is designed for precise neck support. With 44° rotation and 7 cm of vertical adjustment, you can easily position the headrest to suit your preferred posture, reducing neck strain and enhancing overall comfort.</p>",
