        "text_R4je3R": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Recline Range and Footrest</h3><p>Achieve your ideal seating position with the <strong>Adjustable Recline Range</strong> from 95° to 138°. Combined with the retractable footrest, this feature allows you to fully relax, making it easy to take a break without leaving your chair.</p>",
