            "text": "<h3>Adjustable Ergonomic Design for All Heights</h3><p>The SIHOO X5 Pro Gaming Chair adapts perfectly to users of different heights, offering personalised support and comfort for everyone. Adjustable headrest, armrests, and lumbar support ensure an ideal fit, whether you’re 180 cm or 172 cm tall, making it the go-to choice for all body types.</p>",
